[en.FOCUS_C08_LOYAL_ALLIES]
Loyal Allies

[en.FOCUS_C08_LOYAL_ALLIES_desc]
During the last contact day, we have sent a radio to Discord and Sunset Shimer to ensure smooth communication.\n\nAfter the “Jahr Null” execution, the communication between the Resistance was almost in a state of chaos. Now that the radio is open, use it to restore the communication line when the next contact day arrives.

[zh.FOCUS_C08_LOYAL_ALLIES]
忠实盟友

[zh.FOCUS_C08_LOYAL_ALLIES_desc]
上一个联络日时，我们已经向无序和余晖烁烁各送了一部电台，用以确保联络畅通。\n\n“新元年”的处决后，联合抵抗组织之间几乎处于联络混乱的状态。现在电台已经开通，那么在下一个联络日到来的时候，用电台来恢复联络线吧。

